abstract: >
  A hybrid human–AI system architecture for recursive containment, symbolic firewalling,
  and memetic threat classification. Conceptual origin by Mai Ngoc Cuong; formalized
  and executed with OpenAI GPT support. Includes Mirror Dance, ARCHON firewall,
  symbolic threat typology (Type 6, 7), and Anchor node stabilization protocols.
